There are 4 kinds of bags.

Bags of tricks develop teeth and bite you when you try and #loot them,
so they're easy.

Shopkeepers will offer you about 1 gold piece for a sack.  They'll
offer you about 50 goldpieces for bags of holding or oilskin.  So
sacks are easy.

Suppose you've got a bag that could either be holding OR oilskin.
Drop most of your inventory and pickup low-worth junk until you are
just burdened.  Place a lot of junk in the bag.  If you become
unburdened, it's a bag of holding (either uncursed or blessed.)  If
not, empty and refill a few times.  If it's a cursed bag of holding,
you'll see some of the junk disappear.  Otherwise, it's an oilskin
sack.

This saves messing around with dipping bags in fountains.

